/E (      As the heir of Raja Lakandula and his first wife, Hara Marikit, Hiraya knows that someday everything in Marilag would be hers to rule and protect. She was taught the traditions of her people, the rules and customs of the court and the responsibilities expected of a future Hara. Until that time, she had believed that as a Dayang it meant learning how to rule. She had yet to understand that ruling and serving were not two different duties.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
