/E (    The Sultanate of Akbar, a powerful maritime sultanate beyond Marilag's southern waters, had offered grain, ships, and protection for Marilag's trade routes. Its ruler, Sultan Jalal, controlled a powerful fleet, while his eldest son, Ladja Makusug, was the heir to the sultanate. Akbar's offer appeared generous. There was only one condition. Hiraya would marry Makusug.)
