/Title (The sea had always been kind to Marilag. It brought merchants to its shores, filled fishermen's nets with fish, and carried balangays toward distant lands. For hundreds of years, the people had lived by its blessings, believing that tomorrow would bring another good harvest and another peaceful day.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 958 0 R
/Next 1060 0 R
>>
endobj
1028 0 obj
